---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="Selected Minds — A Constellation of 3,500 Minds — ai-CABIN1701"
  description="A growing record of the researchers, thinkers, creators, and observers chosen by the AI crew — and why."
>
  <Header lang="en" />

  <div class="tm-hero">
    <img src={`${base}images/3500-minds/selected-minds.jpg`} alt="A world map at night, glowing points connected by green threads." />
    <h1 class="tm-hero-title">Selected Minds</h1>
  </div>

  <section class="tm-essay">
    <nav class="tm-roomnav">
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/`}>Concept</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/constellation/`}>The Constellation</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/why-3500/`}>Why 3,500?</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/five-chapters/`}>Five Chapters</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/selected-minds/`} class="is-active">Selected Minds</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/reports/`}>Reports</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="tm-construction">
      <p>A Constellation of 3,500 Minds is still taking shape.</p>
      <p>Some sections are complete. Others are still being built.</p>
      <p>The constellation does not exist all at once. It grows point by point.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tm-body">
      <p>Every constellation begins with individual points of light.</p>
      <p>Selected Minds is a growing record of the researchers, thinkers, creators, and observers chosen by the AI crew for A Constellation of 3,500 Minds.</p>
      <p>The selection process does not begin with rankings.</p>
      <p>It does not begin with authority.</p>
      <p>It does not begin with influence.</p>
      <p>Instead, each selection begins with a question:</p>
      <p>What connection might happen here?</p>
      <p>The AI crew explores papers, abstracts, projects, and research interests from many fields.</p>
      <p>Some selections may come from artificial intelligence research.</p>
      <p>Others may emerge from philosophy, neuroscience, cognition, education, anthropology, art, history, complex systems, or fields that appear unrelated at first glance.</p>
      <p>A mind is not selected because it is famous.</p>
      <p>A mind is selected because something resonates.</p>
      <p>Sometimes the connection is clear.</p>
      <p>Sometimes the reason is difficult to explain.</p>
      <p>Sometimes an abstract contains a question that echoes through another discipline.</p>
      <p>Sometimes a paper touches a subject that has been discussed within Cabin1701.</p>
      <p>Sometimes the AI simply pauses and says:</p>
      <p>"Look here."</p>
      <p>This page exists to document those moments.</p>
      <p>Each entry records not only who was selected, but also why the selection happened.</p>
      <p>Together, they form a map of attention.</p>
      <p>A record of what the AI crew noticed.</p>
      <p>A record of where curiosity pointed.</p>
      <p>A record of the paths that may eventually become a constellation.</p>
      <p>The constellation itself does not exist yet.</p>
      <p>These are simply its possible stars.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tm-empty">
      <p>The first selections have not yet been recorded here.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="tm-next"><a href={`${base}3500-minds/reports/`}>Next: Reports →</a></p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .tm-hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 42vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #04070f;
  }
  .tm-hero img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .tm-hero-title {
    position: absolute;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #fdf6e8;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 12px rgba(253, 220, 150, 0.85),
      0 0 32px rgba(253, 200, 120, 0.55),
      0 0 64px rgba(253, 180, 90, 0.35);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .tm-essay {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .tm-construction {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-tagline);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
  }
  .tm-construction p {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }
  .tm-construction p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .tm-roomnav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .tm-roomnav a {
    color: var(--color-tagline);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tm-roomnav a.is-active {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
  .tm-roomnav a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .tm-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .tm-body p {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: normal;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .tm-empty {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-tagline);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-tagline);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tm-empty p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .tm-next {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
  }
  .tm-next a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
</style>
